config BR2_PACKAGE_AFTER_DARK_TOASTERS
	bool "after-dark-toasters"
	help
	  The Flying Toasters' pictures (a toaster's four wing frames,
	  a slice of toast), as After Dark CSS has them, for the
	  chumby-toasters screen saver. Downloaded at build time, not
	  kept in this repository: the pictures are (c) 1989 Berkeley
	  Systems.

	  https://www.bryanbraun.com/after-dark-css/
